                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-9143\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libcrypto3\nVersion: 3.3.2-r0\nFix Version: 3.3.2-r1\nType: apk\nLocation: /lib/apk/db/installed\nData Namespace: alpine:distro:alpine:3.20\nLink: [CVE-2024-9143](https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2024-9143)",
